  "description": "<p>This personalized Christian welcome mat features uplifting messages and faith-filled designs, creating a warm and spiritually enriching entryway to your home. It can be customized with your desired text, making it a unique gift for friends or family. This versatile doormat is suitable for both indoor and outdoor use, adding a personal and blessed touch to any space.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features uplifting Christian messages and faith-filled designs.</li>\n<li>Offers customization to add your desired text.</li>\n<li>Soft to the touch on bare feet.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a non-slip backing and is washable for easy care.</li>\n<li>Highly versatile for various indoor and outdoor placements.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Multiple</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Washable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>customized prayer mat with name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Christian, Jesus, Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft touching on bare feet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Do not bleach and let air dry. Hose or sponge clean with water and mild liquid soap for the best use.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is suitable for various locations, including entryways, bedrooms, bathrooms, and living rooms. Its durable design allows for both indoor and outdoor placement, making it a welcoming addition to any home.</p>",
